I'm not familiar with a diagram language called "Draftably," so I can't write valid source for it without guessing at the syntax. If you share its documentation or a short example, I'll convert the diagram to it.

In the meantime, here is the workflow in Mermaid, which you could adapt:

```mermaid
---
title: Order approval workflow
---
flowchart TD
    start([Start]) --> validate[Validate order]
    validate --> payment{Payment authorized?}
    payment -- No --> cancel[Cancel order]
    payment -- Yes --> reserve[Reserve stock]
    reserve --> stock{Stock available?}
    stock -- No --> cancel
    stock -- Yes --> pack[Pack order]
    pack --> ship[Ship order]
    ship --> finish([End])
    cancel --> finish
```
